vito (https://github.com/9-8-7-6/vito)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This project is built upon vito by 9-8-7-6, also distributed under the MIT
License. vito provided the original Axum-based project skeleton, including:

  - Axum 0.8 application structure
  - axum-login authentication scaffolding
  - sqlx migration setup
  - tower middleware patterns
  - Docker / docker-compose layout
  - Argon2 password hashing integration

OpenAccounting retains vito's project skeleton and rewrites the core domain
(chart of accounts, double-entry transactions, postings, documents, reports)
to deliver proper bookkeeping semantics rather than vito's original
asset-tracking scope.

